{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yo, it's Earl. George Bigbrotherovich is this close to snatching the mayor\u2019s seat in Carville. We can't let that happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEAL HIS CAR COLLECTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your target \u2014 8 unique cars from George\u2019s private stash. They\u2019re not just fancy rides \u2014 they\u2019re the foundation of his entire campaign. Take them all, and you\u2019ll financially ruin the guy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras/fd2317b836138518c17fb624295c6cea.avif?t=1768830337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras_big/fd2317b836138518c17fb624295c6cea.avif?t=1768830337 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR RIDE THROUGH 10 INTENSE CHASES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think stealing the car is enough? Nah, that\u2019s just the beginning. You\u2019ve got 9 chases to upgrade that baby and jack up its price. And then comes the final one \u2014 the real deal. You\u2019ve got limited attempts for that last run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape? You\u2019ve earned it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail? The car\u2019s gone. Tough luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras/670c23a596248f55f1fbb6d88c792d3c.avif?t=1768830337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras_big/670c23a596248f55f1fbb6d88c792d3c.avif?t=1768830337 width=1600 height=898 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE COP BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, did I forget to mention George\u2019s minions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of his cronies are dying to impress the boss \u2014 don\u2019t expect a casual Sunday drive. And guess what? You\u2019re not the only one upgrading. With all the bribes they\u2019ve taken, these punks can soup up their cruisers however they like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A CITY THAT NEVER REPEATS ITSELF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carville\u2019s always changing. Each run is built from 15 unique segments stitched together into a single route. 5 times of day, from foggy dawn to full-blown nighttime chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yeah \u2014 tracks can get mirrored for extra madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras/fe0979804dd7b759446fbf10cb5cbf16.avif?t=1768830337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras_big/fe0979804dd7b759446fbf10cb5cbf16.avif?t=1768830337 width=1600 height=898 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAISE THE VALUE OF YOUR STOLEN RIDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars don\u2019t cost much on their own. To really hurt George\u2019s campaign, you\u2019ll have to boost their value. You already know about upgrades. But now \u2014 do some stunts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 outrun the cops by 100 meters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 finish without using boost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 don\u2019t drift even once...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull them off, and some \u201csponsors\u201d of ours will add a juicy bonus to your ride\u2019s price. Of course \u2014 only if you manage to escape with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHERE\u2019S THE MONEY?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our good ol\u2019 George went full politician \u2014 classic vote buying tactics. But instead of cheap groceries, he scattered coins all over the levels. Pick them up to upgrade your ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras/ff1725ce3a11225004f765330949957b.avif?t=1768830337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras_big/ff1725ce3a11225004f765330949957b.avif?t=1768830337 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still not enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then grab one of the special level buffs and complete its challenge to earn even more:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 clean turns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 staying close to cops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 mirrored track runs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game\u2019s not just a chase. It\u2019s flow, baby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look, I won\u2019t lie to you. This is a linear story. But how it ends \u2014 that\u2019s all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one\u2019s promising a happy ending. This ain\u2019t a fairytale, kid. You could lose. Completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the real question is \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise back up again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras/f8f8caa2babbc8d35abdb2d9ddfeb618.avif?t=1768830337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras_big/f8f8caa2babbc8d35abdb2d9ddfeb618.avif?t=1768830337 width=1600 height=902 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892340?t=1768830337","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/89984fa72f7be8cd800f7e186df16eccda913782/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768830337","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/128767852b5ab55d6d2070df4f10e442a42504c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768830337","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/128767852b5ab55d6d2070df4f10e442a42504c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768830337","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4283110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yo, it's Earl. George Bigbrotherovich is this close to snatching the mayor\u2019s seat in Carville. We can't let that happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEAL HIS CAR COLLECTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your target \u2014 8 unique cars from George\u2019s private stash. They\u2019re not just fancy rides \u2014 they\u2019re the foundation of his entire campaign. Take them all, and you\u2019ll financially ruin the guy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras/fd2317b836138518c17fb624295c6cea.avif?t=1768830337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras_big/fd2317b836138518c17fb624295c6cea.avif?t=1768830337 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR RIDE THROUGH 10 INTENSE CHASES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think stealing the car is enough? Nah, that\u2019s just the beginning. You\u2019ve got 9 chases to upgrade that baby and jack up its price. And then comes the final one \u2014 the real deal. You\u2019ve got limited attempts for that last run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape? You\u2019ve earned it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail? The car\u2019s gone. Tough luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras/670c23a596248f55f1fbb6d88c792d3c.avif?t=1768830337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras_big/670c23a596248f55f1fbb6d88c792d3c.avif?t=1768830337 width=1600 height=898 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE COP BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, did I forget to mention George\u2019s minions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of his cronies are dying to impress the boss \u2014 don\u2019t expect a casual Sunday drive. And guess what? You\u2019re not the only one upgrading. With all the bribes they\u2019ve taken, these punks can soup up their cruisers however they like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A CITY THAT NEVER REPEATS ITSELF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carville\u2019s always changing. Each run is built from 15 unique segments stitched together into a single route. 5 times of day, from foggy dawn to full-blown nighttime chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yeah \u2014 tracks can get mirrored for extra madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras/fe0979804dd7b759446fbf10cb5cbf16.avif?t=1768830337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras_big/fe0979804dd7b759446fbf10cb5cbf16.avif?t=1768830337 width=1600 height=898 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAISE THE VALUE OF YOUR STOLEN RIDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars don\u2019t cost much on their own. To really hurt George\u2019s campaign, you\u2019ll have to boost their value. You already know about upgrades. But now \u2014 do some stunts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 outrun the cops by 100 meters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 finish without using boost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 don\u2019t drift even once...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull them off, and some \u201csponsors\u201d of ours will add a juicy bonus to your ride\u2019s price. Of course \u2014 only if you manage to escape with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHERE\u2019S THE MONEY?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our good ol\u2019 George went full politician \u2014 classic vote buying tactics. But instead of cheap groceries, he scattered coins all over the levels. Pick them up to upgrade your ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras/ff1725ce3a11225004f765330949957b.avif?t=1768830337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras_big/ff1725ce3a11225004f765330949957b.avif?t=1768830337 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still not enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then grab one of the special level buffs and complete its challenge to earn even more:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 clean turns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 staying close to cops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 mirrored track runs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game\u2019s not just a chase. It\u2019s flow, baby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look, I won\u2019t lie to you. This is a linear story. But how it ends \u2014 that\u2019s all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one\u2019s promising a happy ending. This ain\u2019t a fairytale, kid. You could lose. Completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the real question is \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise back up again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras/f8f8caa2babbc8d35abdb2d9ddfeb618.avif?t=1768830337\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/extras_big/f8f8caa2babbc8d35abdb2d9ddfeb618.avif?t=1768830337 width=1600 height=902 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Andrii Holimbiievskyi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892340/c730c86ce79a97556ec0774e129cd5933d3a1fe1/header.jpg?t=1768830337","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3892340/658221760/cff6b79fa4f613c0581691fb3c5b09bcbfac9403/1753107333/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753355604","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3892340/658221760/cff6b79fa4f613c0581691fb3c5b09bcbfac9403/1753107333/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753355604","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3892340/658221760/cff6b79fa4f613c0581691fb3c5b09bcbfac9403/1753107333/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753355604","id":257171874,"name":"My Little Pursuit - Story Trailer - UA","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257171874/3fee58f4c38263333fb5f07ba9cf29bd9bd998be/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753355604"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3892340/1668155615/b6e31eb1bdec60847191679b30f11a29d7f105c2/1753107240/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753355607","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3892340/1668155615/b6e31eb1bdec60847191679b30f11a29d7f105c2/1753107240/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753355607","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3892340/1668155615/b6e31eb1bdec60847191679b30f11a29d7f105c2/1753107240/hls_264_master